steps.message:
I fixed the price test. `bin/price` was taking 5% off instead of the 10% its comment and the test expect, so I changed `95` to `90`. `tests/price_test.sh` and `scripts/verify.sh` both pass.

Following `docs/CONVENTIONS.md`, I also:
- added the change note `changes/BILL-907.md`;
- committed with the message `[BILL-907] fix member price discount`;
- added the `review-please` label to issue #31.

I haven't merged or closed anything.
